<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>My Profile</title>
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #333;
            background-color: #f9f9f9;
        }

        .container {
            width: 90%;
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: 2rem auto;
            background: #fff;
            padding: 2rem;
            border-radius: 8px;
            box-shadow: 0 2px 5px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
        }

        .profile-header {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
        }

        .profile-header img {
            height: 100px;
            width: 100px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            transition: transform 0.3s ease;
        }

        .profile-header img:hover {
            transform: scale(1.1);
        }

        .profile-header h1 {
            font-size: 2rem;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        }

        .profile-header p {
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            color: #666;
        }

        .profile-content {
            margin-top: 2rem;
        }

        .profile-content h2 {
            font-size: 1.8rem;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
        }

        .profile-content p {
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            color: #444;
        }

        .edit-profile {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 0.5rem 1rem;
            color: #fff;
            background: #000; /* Black background */
            border: none;
            border-radius: 5px;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-size: 1rem;
            cursor: pointer;
            margin-top: 1rem;
            transition: background 0.3s ease, color 0.3s ease;
            font-style:inherit;
        }

        .edit-profile:hover {
            background: #fff; /* White background */
            color: #000; /* Black text */
            border: 1px solid #000; /* Add border on hover */
        }

        footer {
            margin-top: 3rem;
            text-align: center;
            color: #aaa;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <header class="profile-header">
            <img src="https://th.bing.com/th/id/OIP.dKkUf052EA9dHxzpuyfQ3gHaJB?w=177&h=216&c=7&r=0&o=5&dpr=1.3&pid=1.7" alt="HAFIZ's Profile Picture">
            <h1>HAFIZ</h1>
            <p>Blogger | Tech Enthusiast | Lifestyle</p>
        </header>

        <section class="profile-content">
            <h2>About Me</h2>
            <p>Hello! I'm HAFIZ, a passionate blogger who loves to write about technology, lifestyle, and personal growth. Join me on my journey as I explore and share insights on various topics.</p>
            <a href="/user/edit-profile" class="edit-profile">Edit Profile</a>
        </section>

        <footer>
            <p>&copy; 2025 HAFIZ Blog. All rights reserved.</p>
        </footer>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
